    "content_html": "<div class= \"container-fluid\">\r\n  <div class= \"row align-items-start\">\r\n   <div class=\"col col-lg-8\">\r\n   <p>In an industrial system of gas cleaning, the fabric is media made into either an envelope or a tube. These envelopes or tubes are called the bags and a housing of these is called Bag Filter or Bag House.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"col\">\r\n<center><p><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Reverse-Jet_Baghouse.png\" style=\"max-width: 50vh;\"></p><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Reverse-Jet_Baghouse.png\">Unknown authorUnknown author (US government)</a>, Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons<br/></small></small></center>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>",
