    "content_html": "Major Ions in Water:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Cations: Common cations include calcium (Ca²⁺), magnesium (Mg²⁺), sodium (Na⁺), and potassium (K⁺).</li>\r\n<li>Anions: Common anions include bicarbonate (HCO₃⁻), carbonate (CO₃²⁻), sulfate (SO₄²⁻), and chloride (Cl⁻).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\nOther Chemical Characteristics:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>pH and Alkalinity</li>\r\n<li>Hardness</li>\r\n<li>Dissolved Oxygen (DO)</li>\r\n<li>Nutrients</li>\r\n<li>Dissolved Gases</li>\r\n</ul>",
