    "discipline": "Environmental",
    "subject": "Mathematics",
    "chapter": "Analytic Geometry",
    "topic": "Circle",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<h5><span><b>Equation of circle with center at Origin:</b></span></h5>\r\n<div class= \"container-fluid\">\r\n  <div class= \"row align-items-start\">\r\n   <div class=\"col col-lg-8\">\r\n   Equation of a circle with center at (0,0) and radius = r:\r\n\\[x^{2} + y^{2} = r^{2}\\]\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"col\">\r\n<p><img src=\"https://onedrive.live.com/embed?resid=9C913AE725AFDEB1%21452&authkey=%21AHjhrJBnzUJdY6M&width=340\" width=\"340\" /></p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h5><span><b>Equation of circle with center at point other that Origin:</b></span></h5>\r\n\r\n<div class= \"container-fluid\">\r\n  <div class= \"row align-items-start\">\r\n   <div class=\"col col-lg-8\">\r\n   <p>Equation of a circle with center at (h,k) and radius = r</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$(x-h)^{2} + (y-k)^{2} = r^{2}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 44</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\nor in another form: \\[x^{2} + y^{2} + 2gx + 2fy + c = 0\\] which has center at (-g,-f) and<br />\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$r = \\sqrt{g^{2} + f^{2} - c}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 45</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"col\">\r\n <p><img src=\"https://onedrive.live.com/embed?resid=9C913AE725AFDEB1%21453&authkey=%21AOSUqKnkrNiI-18&width=340\" width=\"340\"/></p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>",
    "important": "If center is at (0,0)\r\n\\[x^{2} + y^{2} = r^{2}\\]\r\n<br/>\r\n<br/>\r\nIf center is at (h,k)\r\n\\[(x-h)^{2} + (y-k)^{2} = r^{2}\\]",
    "resources": "<div class=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1dmGOO-RI30IDtS_R7Ak4To_0MnqT2vr8/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/40 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-blue-200 transition-colors\">📄 Homework</a><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1fIWiSeGRzNBHWrc__xmOZdGkjvDLegGy/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/40 text-green-700 dark:text-green-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-green-200 transition-colors\">✅ Solution</a><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1FCvwh531qga0MHLiWlMFrtGa0rSAmtTu/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/40 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-purple-200 transition-colors\">👨‍🏫 Tutoring</a><!-- <div class=\"w-full mt-2\"><div style=\"padding:57.97% 0 0 0;position:relative;\"><iframe allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/591185831?badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479&amp;h=737782fc6a\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;\" title=\"Equation of Circle\"></iframe></div>\r\n<script src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js\"></script>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:75% 0 0 0;position:relative;\"><iframe allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/569845464?badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;\" title=\"Circle-II\"></iframe></div>\r\n<script src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js\"></script></div> --></div>",
