    "discipline": "Environmental",
    "subject": "Mathematics",
    "chapter": "Basic Math",
    "topic": "Logarithms",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<div class= \"container-fluid\">\r\n  <div class= \"row align-items-start\">\r\n   <div class=\"col col-lg-8\">\r\n   <p>Logarithm can be seen as opposite of exponent.<br />\r\nlf <span class=\"math inline\">\\(a^{b}=x\\)</span> then, <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(\\log_{a}x=b\\)</span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><p>Multiplication property <span class=\"math display\">\\[\\log\r\n\\left(xy \\right) =\\log x+\\log y\\]</span></p></li>\r\n<li><p>Division property <span class=\"math display\">\\[\\log \\left(\r\n\\dfrac{x}{y}\\right) =\\log x - \\log y\\]</span></p></li>\r\n<li><p>Power Property <span class=\"math display\">\\[\\log x^{y}=y\\log\r\nx\\]</span></p></li>\r\n<li><p>Change of base property <span class=\"math display\">\\[\\log\r\n_{a}b=\\dfrac{\\log _{c}b}{\\log _{c}a}\\]</span></p></li>\r\n\r\n<li><p>Since exponential function and (natural) logarithm are opposite of each other, \r\n\\[e^{\\ln x} = x\\]\r\n</p></li>\r\n\r\n</ol>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"col\">\r\n<center><small><small></small></small></center><p><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e6/Logarithm1.png\" style=\"max-width: 50vh;\"></p><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Logarithm1.png\">Phlsph7</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0\">CC BY 4.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>",
    "important": "lf $a^{b}=x$ then, $log_{a}x=b$<br/>\r\n\r\n\\[\\log \\left(xy \\right) =\\log x+\\log y\\]\r\n\r\n\\[\\log \\left(\\dfrac{x}{y}\\right) =\\log x - \\log y\\]\r\n\r\n\\[\\log_{a}b=\\dfrac{\\log _{c}b}{\\log _{c}a}\\]",
    "resources": "<div class=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1waiM_TELnv9dJAfTWQgHwe72Z82mcw4U/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/40 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-blue-200 transition-colors\">📄 Homework</a><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1b012mQwo34rZQMwGVorfM6_SkdREaqic/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/40 text-green-700 dark:text-green-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-green-200 transition-colors\">✅ Solution</a><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QdOQlqTHaEib-of2Yan46NvlTpc58FnP/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/40 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-purple-200 transition-colors\">👨‍🏫 Tutoring</a></div>",
