    "chapter": "Calculus",
    "topic": "Derivatives",
    "subtopic": "Some Basic Formulae",
    "content_html": "<h5><span><b>Some Basic Formulae:</b></span></h5>\r\n<p><span class=\"math display\">\\[\\dfrac{d}{dx} \\ c = 0\\]</span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"math display\">\\[\\dfrac{d}{dx} ( u \\pm v \\pm w \\pm ....) = \\dfrac{du}{dx} \\pm \\dfrac{dv}{dx} \\pm \\dfrac{dw}{dx} \\pm .....\\]</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span class=\"math display\">\\[\\dfrac{d}{dx} ( cu ) = c \\dfrac{du}{dx}\\]</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span class=\"math display\">\\[\\dfrac{d}{dx} ( uv ) = u\\dfrac{dv}{dx} + v\\dfrac{du}{dx}\\]</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span class=\"math display\">\\[\\dfrac{d}{dx} ( \\dfrac {u}{v}) = \\dfrac{v\\frac{du}{dx} - u\\dfrac{dv}{dx} }{v^{2}}\\]</span></p>\n<div class=\"text-center mt-3\">\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">Product Rule: $\\dfrac{d}{dx}(uv) = u\\dfrac{dv}{dx} + v\\dfrac{du}{dx}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; Page 52</span></button>\n</div><br/>\n<div class=\"text-center\">\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">Quotient Rule: $\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left(\\dfrac{u}{v}\\right) = \\dfrac{v\\frac{du}{dx} - u\\frac{dv}{dx}}{v^2}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; Page 52</span></button>\n</div><br/>\n",
    "important": "Product Rule:\r\n\\[\\dfrac{d}{dx}(uv) = u\\dfrac{dv}{dx} + v\\dfrac{du}{dx}\\]\r\n\r\nQuotient Rule:\r\n\\[\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left(\\dfrac{u}{v}\\right) = \\dfrac{v\\frac{du}{dx} - u\\frac{dv}{dx}}{v^2}\\]",
    "resources": "<div class=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1O7K69uNKRVhtUtnJrH_Uj-ucZMkhaBx8/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/40 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-blue-200 transition-colors\">📄 Homework</a><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Ws8-tbyPJsw_St_cud2yMtTCezn6QFkG/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/40 text-green-700 dark:text-green-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-green-200 transition-colors\">✅ Solution</a><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1e50LIaBvPy4XtZ9UG-FBxZo7QODv3eCQ/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/40 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-purple-200 transition-colors\">👨‍🏫 Tutoring</a><!-- <div class=\"w-full mt-2\"><div style=\"padding:56.25% 0 0 0;position:relative;\"><iframe src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1003086591?h=10f20c9656&amp;badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; clipboard-write\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;\" title=\"Derivatives\"></iframe></div><script src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js\"></script></div> --></div>",
