    "content_html": "<h5><span><b>Expected Value of a Continuous Function:</b></span></h5>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\mu = E(X) = \\displaystyle \\int_{-\\infty}^\\infty x\\ f(x)$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 66</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>",
    "important": "Continuous Expected Value:\r\n\\[\\mu = E(X) = \\displaystyle \\int_{-\\infty}^\\infty x\\ f(x) dx\\]",
