    "discipline": "Environmental",
    "subject": "Fluid Mechanics and Hydraulics",
    "chapter": "Airfoil Theory",
    "topic": "Airfoil Theory",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<div class= \"container-fluid\">\r\n  <div class= \"row align-items-start\">\r\n   <div class=\"col col-lg-8\">\r\n   Lift force,\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$F_L = \\dfrac{C_L \\rho v^2 A_p}{2}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 198</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\nCoefficient of Drag\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$C_D = {C_D}_\\infty + \\dfrac{(C_L)^2}{\\pi A R}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 198</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\nAspect Ratio\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$A_R = \\dfrac{b^2}{A_p}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 198</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"col\">\r\n<center><p><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9c/Airfoil_lift_and_drag.svg\" style=\"max-width: 50vh;\"></p><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Airfoil_lift_and_drag.svg\">Vector by רונאלדיניו המלך, Original by J Doug McLean</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons<br/></small></small></center>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>",
    "important": "Lift force,\r\n\\[F_L = \\dfrac{C_L \\rho v^2 A_p}{2}\\]\r\n\r\nCoefficient of Drag\r\n\\[C_D = {C_D}_\\infty + \\dfrac{(C_L)^2}{\\pi A R}\\]\r\n\r\nAspect Ratio\r\n\\[A_R = \\dfrac{b^2}{A_p}\\]",
