    "topic": "Fan Characteristics",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "The fan power of a backward curved fan is given by:\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\dot{W} = \\dfrac{\\Delta PQ}{\\eta_f}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 192</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nwhere<br/>\r\n$\\dot{W}$ = Fan power<br/>\r\n$\\Delta$P = Pressure rise<br/>\r\n$\\eta_f$ = Fan efficiency<br/>",
    "important": "",
    "resources": "",
