    "content_html": "<div class= \"container-fluid\">\r\n  <div class= \"row align-items-start\">\r\n   <div class=\"col col-lg-8\">\r\n   <div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$P_1 A_1 - P_2A_2 \\cos \\alpha - F_x = Q \\rho (v_2 \\cos \\alpha - v_1) $ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 187</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"col\">\r\n<center><p><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/Pipe_bend_schematic.svg\" style=\"max-width: 50vh;\"></p><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pipe_bend_schematic.svg\">Olivier Cleynen</a>, CC0, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>",
