    "discipline": "Environmental",
    "subject": "Fluid Mechanics and Hydraulics",
    "chapter": "Internal Flow",
    "topic": "Multipath Pipeline",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<h5><b>Pipes in Series</b></h5>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container-fluid\">\r\n\t<div class=\"row align-items-start\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"col col-lg-8\">\r\n<p>Flow remains same in all pipes. <span class=\"math display\">\\[Q = Q_1 = Q_2 = Q_3 =....= A_1 v_1 = A_2 v_2 = ....\\]</span> Total head loss of head= Loss of head in pipe 1 + Loss of head in pipe 2 + Loss of head in pipe 3. <span class=\"math display\">\\[h_f = h_{f_1} + h_{f_2} + h_{f_3} + ....\\]</span></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n    \t\t<div class=\"col\">\r\n     <center><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4b/EDF_Pipes_5632.JPG\" alt=\"Pipes Connected in Series\" width=\"340\"><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:EDF_Pipes_5632.JPG\">Clem Rutter, Rochester, Kent.</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0\">CC BY 3.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/>\r\n    \t\t</div>\r\n  \t</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<h5><b>Pipes in Parallel</b></h5>\r\n<div class=\"container-fluid\">\r\n\t<div class=\"row align-items-start\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"col col-lg-8\">\r\n\r\nTotal discharge is the sum of the individual discharges in the parallel pipes.\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$Q = Q_1 + Q_2 + Q_3 + ....$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 187</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\nAlso, head loss across each pipe branch will be same.<br />\r\n<span class=\"math display\">\\[h_{f_1} = h_{f_2} = h_{f_3} = ...\\]</span></p>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n    \t\t<div class=\"col\">\r\n     <center><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e9/Pipe_Network.png\" alt=\"Pipe Network\" width=\"340\"><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pipe_Network.png\">Ryan Toomey</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/>\r\n\r\n    \t\t</div>\r\n  \t</div>\r\n</div>",
    "important": "Pipes in Series \r\n\\[Q = A_1v_1 = A_2v_2\\]\r\n\\[h_f = h_{f_1} + h_{f_2} + h_{f_3} + ....\\]\r\n\r\nPipes in Parallel\r\n\\[Q= Q_1+Q_2+Q_3\\]\r\n\\[h_{f_1} = h_{f_2} = h_{f_3} = ...\\]",
    "resources": "",
    "images": [],
    "local_images": []
