    "content_html": "<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$(P_2 + \\gamma z_2) - (P_1 + \\gamma z_1) = -\\Delta x \\rho a_x$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 182</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\nThis is used when the flow is unsteady due to local acceleration.",
